// Delivery events the provider reported for outgoing emails the outbox does not hold.
// Backs the "the provider is reporting on mail we never sent" alert: each such event's correlation
// names the outbox but a tenant, or a row, that does not exist, so it is dropped and logged as
// OutboxDeliveryEventUnmatched. A stray few are expected (an event that outlived its row's
// retention, a webhook replayed against the wrong environment); a steady stream points at a
// correlation that is being written wrongly, or at another system's mail reaching this endpoint.
// More than 10 in the window is a starting point.
customMetrics
| where name == "tellma.outbox.delivery_updates"
| extend result = tostring(customDimensions["result"])
| where result == "unmatched"
| summarize unmatched = sum(valueSum) by bin(timestamp, 15m)
| where unmatched > 10
